      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 253]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Culture)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Our culture is different from other cultures."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "For example, our clothes, housing, names, and language are not"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "like that of any other country."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I would like to explain about our traditional food."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Traditional Korean meals include boiled rice, soup, fish or meat,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "several vegetable side dishes, and, one or more kinds of kimchi."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My favorite food is bulgogi."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Bulgogi is the most popular Korean meat dish."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I am used to eating these delicious foods every day."
    },
